			"notes": "## ✨ Features\n- Added UI sounds to enhance GUI interaction.\n\n## 🐛 Bug Fixes\n- Prevented block removal tasks from being executed on buildings to protect them from accidental destruction.\n- Updated the repair building screen to lock the Repair button when there are insufficient items.\n\n## 🔧 Quality of Life\n- Pawns will continue working when hungry, albeit at a slower pace.\n- Cleared inventory automatically when switching to survival mode."
		},
