			"notes": "# Changelog\n\n## ✨ Features\n- Pawns will now wander around the fortress more naturally during the day.\n- Added more randomness to how often farmers sprint back to check on crops.\n\n## 🐛 Bug Fixes\n- Fixed water spreading incorrectly when buildings containing water are destroyed.\n- Resolved an issue in the blueprints menu where it incorrectly stated there were not enough items.\n- Fixed pawns not taking free beds when available.\n\n## 🔧 Quality of Life\n- Renamed \"Functions\" tab to \"Actions\" tab for clarity.\n- Adjusted predefined blueprints capacity for better balance.\n- Updated wording and requirements for the Blacksmith profession.\n- Changed forester requirement from shears to a wooden hoe for early game balance.\n- Restricted basic building tasks to default worker pawns/colonists only."
		},
